      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAPPY AND NUMB (1) well back settling but did wind up strongly to finish 4th and beaten only 1.75 lengths (23.17) at Warragul. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. GENESIS BALE (2) was prominent throughout when winning two back then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 2.5 lengths at this track (23.98). Can measure up. WHISKY POINT (4) goes very well here starting eight times for three wins and three minors. Missed the frame latest (23.11) when fourth over 400m at Geelong in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish. PAW QUANTUM (8) must be included in calculations.",
